---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import LegalNav from '../../components/LegalNav.astro';

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<Shell
	title='Disclaimers — ArenaSwap'
	description='ArenaSwap disclaims affiliation with ESPN and with every league named, provides its software without warranty, and relies upon data it does not control.'
	path='legal/terms/'
>
	<div class='container'>
		<div class='page-head'>
			<h1 class='page-title'>Disclaimers.</h1>
		</div>

		<div class='reading-shell'>
			<LegalNav current='legal/terms/' />

			<div class='prose'>
				<h2>No affiliation</h2>
				<p>
					ArenaSwap is not affiliated with, sponsored by, endorsed by or otherwise connected to
					ESPN, the NFL, the NBA, the WNBA, the NHL, MLB, MLS, the NWSL, the NCAA, the UFL, FIFA,
					UEFA, the International Olympic Committee, or any other league, club, broadcaster or
					streaming service. League and team names, marks and crests are the property of their
					respective owners and appear here for the sole purpose of identifying games.
				</p>

				<h2>Not a streaming service</h2>
				<p>
					ArenaSwap does not host, rebroadcast, decrypt, unlock or otherwise furnish access to any
					game. It moves between browser tabs that you have opened yourself, upon services you are
					already entitled to view. Whether you are entitled to view a given game is a matter
					between you and the party that sells it to you.
				</p>

				<h2>Data obtained from third parties</h2>
				<p>
					Scores, game clocks, schedules, odds and win probabilities are obtained from ESPN.
					ArenaSwap does not control that data, cannot warrant that it is accurate, complete,
					current or available, and has no influence over when it changes. Such data may be
					delayed, erroneous or absent, and a stream will ordinarily run behind the data feed.
					Nothing presented in the extension should be treated as an official score, and no wager
					should be placed in reliance upon it.
				</p>

				<h2>PowerScore is an estimate</h2>
				<p>
					PowerScore estimates from publicly available figures how compelling a game presently
					appears. It is not a prediction, a probability, a betting model or a statement of fact,
					and it will on occasion direct you away from the game you wished to watch. The
					<a href={`${base}faq/`}>sensitivity, cooldown and favorite team settings</a> exist to
					address that.
				</p>

				<h2>No warranty</h2>
				<p>
					The software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or implied,
					including without limitation the implied warranties of merchantability and fitness for a
					particular purpose. No person involved in ArenaSwap shall be liable for any damages
					arising out of its use. The full text appears on the
					<a href={`${base}legal/licenses/`}>licenses page</a>.
				</p>

				<h2>Availability</h2>
				<p>
					ArenaSwap is provided free of charge, is unfunded, and is maintained in its authors'
					spare time. Browsers alter the rules governing extensions, the services from which it
					reads alter without notice, and nothing here is accompanied by a service level
					agreement. Any feature may be altered or withdrawn in a subsequent version.
				</p>

				<h2>Nothing here is legal advice</h2>
				<p>
					These pages describe the behavior of a browser extension. They do not constitute advice,
					and they create no contract beyond the ISC License under which the software is
					distributed.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</Shell>
